步骤3: 应用ROT13解码：c->p, v->i, p->c, b->o -> 'pico'；P->C, G->T, S->F -> 'CTF'；花括号内：a->n, b->o, g->t -> 'not'；g->t, b->o, b->o -> 'too'；o->b, n->a, q->d -> 'bad'；b->o, s->f -> 'of'；n->a, _->_；c->p, e->r, b->o, o->b, y->l, r->e, z->m -> 'problem'。整体解码为：picoCTF{not_too_bad_of_a_problem}。
